  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; <strong>Brand introduction</strong>: Sarna Baseball is the #1 best selling baseball and softball glove treatment. We offer a unique, updated formula to better break-in and maintain the leather for ball player's gloves. We are made and self-owned by former ball players of all levels, all the way up to the professional level.<br><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; <strong>Product description</strong>: Our products revolve around the sports of baseball and softball. Our top selling products are our glove conditioners. They help break-in, restore and maintain the leather of your mitts. Our premium, unique formual doesn't alter or darken the color of the leather like tradional oils or other glove conditioners.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; <strong>USP (Unique Selling Point)</strong>: Premium quality break-ins and softening while not altering or darkening the leather.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; <strong>Payment terms</strong>: Payments are made once per month (every 30 days). All payments are made via PayPal.</p>",
